  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3203.19 Control period",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.19 “Control period” means the period beginning May 1 of each year and ending on September 30 of the same year, inclusive.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
